      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I fully agree with this.\n\nWe as users should really have the ability to moderate better.\n\nThe only thing stopping us is VRChat's strict rules on specifically world moderation.\n\nGiving us some more wiggle-room, and letting us actually use our full potential when needed can and would save so many headaches, both for world moderators, but also for the users who we're here to protect.\n\nGiving us more freedom in how we are able to get rid of bad actors would severely impact both workflow and QOL positively.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
