      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5ea09825205c8653c54c92c7|full_name} But as stated in the OP, they'll just make new accounts... so...\n\nAnd keeping in mind, this feature is being suggested as a workaround to reporting to VRChat. This means that Accounts that would have otherwise been removed from the platform, had they been reported Trust and Safety, will just go troll other worlds instead, and only when they've been banned by enough creators will they need to make a new account. (IE: Less accounts needed overall, more disruption to the platform.)",
