      "value": "@{630e721b772f1844c73d8664|full_name} Well then this is just a subjective non-starter. Blocking people from your worlds is not going to stop them 'harassing' / 'slandering' you as a Creator, because Furry Hideout is not a prison. (Users are free to come and go as they wish, and you can be 'slandered' anywhere, even if you ban people from your own worlds.)\n\nHonestly, this idea seems to be born out of a deeply personal matter, and I'm not at all convinced that it's not going to be used in vindictive and stupid ways, which is the one of the reasons why I'd be very concerned about anything like this.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
