      "value": "@{630e721b772f1844c73d8664|full_name} \"It shouldn't be labeled as a world moderation, more of a protection for larger creators like myself. (To mitigate Harassment)\"\n\nLet's call it what it is and have an honest conversation yeah?\n\nYou are talking about world creator / moderator bans. You want the ability to permanently ban people from your worlds, and you know that you and other creators will be able to use that power in any way you wish if it is granted. You haven't proposed any constraints on this power except restricting it to certain instance types.",
