      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{618fa6ccbfca2a69d13f829c|full_name}, with VRChats systems now, reporting users doesn't always work especially with users that are Extreme Harassers.\n\nGroups, themselves have a \"Block/Ban\" function. Which bars bad actors from group related worlds and protects the group. (Without reporting them to other communities.)\n\nI offer something that VRChat basically already offers. \n\nI deal with usually the same users over and over again.\n\nSome that have 20+ Accounts, some I can report and get banned from VRChat for tos violations. (Client users) Some are a lot more difficult.\n\nIf you would like to contact me more and brain storm feel free to contact me through VRChat.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
