      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{630e721b772f1844c73d8664|full_name} Can you please define \"Extreme Harassment\"?\n\nIt's important to remember that VRChat just modified their Terms of Service to allow for upcoming in-game reporting features that include automatically including a buffer with reports etc, amongst other things... So this is already expected to get infinitely better in the near term.\n\nThat aside, Group Bans do not have the scale of impact that receiving a World Creator ban would entail, which is why I view this as a false equivalence. Obviously, there are a LOT more Public instances than Group Public instances, and being banned from all Public instances for a particular creator has a much much greater potential to negatively impact a user's overall VRChat experience.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
