      "value": "@{618fa6ccbfca2a69d13f829c|full_name} Extreme Harassment being when someone has an unhealthy need to attack me or my community. \n\nNormal Harassment, \n\n(Someone calling me the N-Word multiple times)\n\nExtreme Harassment, \n\n(Someone making 10 accounts to all sing, Shadow is a Ni***r) usually bots.\n\nPeople taking photos of me at fur-cons to threaten me.\n\nSending me those photos with fucked up captions. \n\nEtc I've seen a lot.",
