      "value": "@{630e721b772f1844c73d8664|full_name} Alright, well, I'm of the opinion that being able to block people from your worlds isn't going to help with your definition of 'Extreme Harassment' - You've already noted most of this is occurring outside VRChat, and that the behaviour which is occurring inside VRChat is A) Specifically targeted at you, not world creators in general B) Already involves a plethora of alt accounts, meaning blocking accounts from worlds isn't going to help much.",
